msgstr "يُسجَّل «%(name)s» لكل قسم، لذا تحتاج هذه الدفعة إلى قسم."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid "'%(name)s' is recorded per work site, so this batch needs one."
msgstr "يُسجَّل «%(name)s» لكل موقع عمل، لذا تحتاج هذه الدفعة إلى موقع."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid "%(existing)s already covers %(component)s for this scope and month."
msgstr "تغطّي %(existing)s بالفعل %(component)s لهذا النطاق وهذا الشهر."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid "Changing this batch"
msgstr "تعديل هذه الدفعة"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid "Only a draft batch can be deleted. %(name)s is %(state)s."
msgstr ""
"لا يمكن حذف إلا الدفعة في وضع المسودة. أمّا %(name)s فحالتها %(state)s."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid "You are not allowed to record %(component)s."
msgstr "غير مصرّح لك بتسجيل %(component)s."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid "You may only record pay for %(allowed)s."
msgstr "لا يمكنك تسجيل المستحقات إلا لـ %(allowed)s."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid "Only a draft batch can be submitted."
msgstr "لا يمكن تقديم إلا الدفعة في وضع المسودة."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid "There is nothing to submit — %(name)s has no entries."
msgstr "لا يوجد ما يُقدَّم — فالدفعة %(name)s لا تحتوي على إدخالات."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid "Only a submitted batch can be returned."
msgstr "لا يمكن إعادة إلا الدفعة المُقدَّمة."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid "%(name)s has been approved. Only the General Manager can reopen it."
msgstr "اعتُمدت %(name)s. ولا يمكن إعادة فتحها إلا للمدير العام."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid ""
"%(scope)s has already been submitted to the General Manager, so its batches "
"are frozen. Ask him to return it — or, if he has not looked yet, take the "
"submission back from the Monthly Pay Run."
msgstr ""
"سُلِّم %(scope)s بالفعل إلى المدير العام، لذا فدفعاته مجمّدة. اطلب منه "
"إعادته — أو اسحب التسليم من دورة المستحقات الشهرية إن لم يكن قد اطّلع بعد."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid "%(label)s must be greater than zero."
msgstr "يجب أن يكون %(label)s أكبر من صفر."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid "Every %(name)s row has to say which one it is: %(options)s."
msgstr "يجب أن يحدّد كل سطر من %(name)s أيَّها هو: %(options)s."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid "'%(option)s' is not one of %(name)s's choices."
msgstr "«%(option)s» ليس من خيارات %(name)s."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid "%(date)s is outside the batch period %(period)s."
msgstr "التاريخ %(date)s خارج فترة الدفعة %(period)s."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid "%(name)s is recorded per occurrence, so each entry needs a date."
msgstr "يُسجَّل %(name)s لكل واقعة، لذا يحتاج كل إدخال إلى تاريخ."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid "%(name)s needs a reason on every entry."
msgstr "يحتاج %(name)s إلى سبب في كل إدخال."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid ""
"Batch %(name)s has been submitted. %(what)s is only possible while it is in "
"Draft."
msgstr "قُدِّمت الدفعة %(name)s. ولا يمكن %(what)s إلا وهي في وضع المسودة."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid ""
"%(employee)s is not in %(scope)s and does not report to you, so you cannot "
"record pay for them."
msgstr ""
"%(employee)s ليس ضمن %(scope)s ولا يتبعك إداريًا، لذا لا يمكنك تسجيل مستحقات"
" له."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid ""
"Batch %(name)s has been submitted. Ask the General Manager to return it "
"before changing it."
msgstr "قُدِّمت الدفعة %(name)s. اطلب من المدير العام إعادتها قبل تعديلها."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid ""
"You are not set as the manager of any department, so there is nothing you "
"can record pay for. Ask HR to set you as the manager of your department, or "
"to make you an assistant to its manager."
msgstr ""
"لست معيَّنًا مديرًا لأي قسم، لذا لا يوجد ما تسجّل له مستحقات. اطلب من "
"الموارد البشرية تعيينك مديرًا لقسمك أو مساعدًا لمديره."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid "y"
msgstr "y"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid "ies"
msgstr "ies"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_batch.py:0
msgid "your departments"
msgstr "أقسامك"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_component.py:0
msgid "A fixed amount, entered by hand."
msgstr "مبلغ ثابت يُدخَل يدويًا."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_component.py:0
msgid "%(option)s at the configured rate"
msgstr "%(option)s بالسعر المُهيَّأ"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_component.py:0
msgid "%(label)s at the configured rate"
msgstr "%(label)s بالسعر المُهيَّأ"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_component.py:0
msgid ""
"Computed in one expression so the hourly rate is never rounded before it is "
"multiplied."
msgstr "يُحتسَب في تعبير واحد حتى لا يُقرَّب سعر الساعة قبل الضرب."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_component.py:0
msgid "Recorded %(label)s"
msgstr "%(label)s المسجَّلة"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_component.py:0
msgid "Earning quantity"
msgstr "الكمية المستحِقّة"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_component.py:0
msgid "No rate tiers apply, so nothing is earned."
msgstr "لا تنطبق أي شريحة سعر، فلا يُستحق شيء."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_component.py:0
msgid ""
"'%(name)s' has options, so its amount has to be a quantity × rate — each "
"option carries its own rate."
msgstr ""
"لمكوّن «%(name)s» خيارات، لذا يجب أن يكون مبلغه بطريقة الكمية × السعر — فكل "
"خيار يحمل سعره الخاص."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_component.py:0
msgid ""
"'%(name)s' derives its rate from the salary, so it needs a divisor (KSW uses"
" 240)."
msgstr ""
"يشتقّ «%(name)s» سعره من الراتب، لذا يحتاج إلى مقسوم عليه (وتعتمد KSW ٢٤٠)."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_component.py:0
msgid "'%(name)s' is tiered but has no rate tiers configured."
msgstr "«%(name)s» ذو شرائح لكن لم تُهيَّأ له أي شريحة سعر."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_component.py:0
msgid "Basic salary"
msgstr "الراتب الأساسي"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_component.py:0
msgid "÷ %(divisor).0f = plain hourly rate"
msgstr "÷ %(divisor).0f = سعر الساعة المجرّد"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_component.py:0
msgid "× %(factor).2f overtime factor"
msgstr "× %(factor).2f معامل العمل الإضافي"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_component.py:0
msgid "× %(qty).2f %(label)s"
msgstr "× %(qty).2f %(label)s"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_component.py:0
msgid "Free allowance (required before earning)"
msgstr "الحد المجاني (مطلوب قبل بدء الاستحقاق)"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_component.py:0
msgid "Using the rates set for %(site)s."
msgstr "باستخدام الأسعار المحدّدة لموقع %(site)s."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_component.py:0
msgid "Using the default rates — %(site)s has none of its own."
msgstr "باستخدام الأسعار الافتراضية — إذ ليس لموقع %(site)s أسعار خاصة به."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_component.py:0
msgid "An option's rate cannot be negative."
msgstr "لا يمكن أن يكون سعر الخيار سالبًا."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_component.py:0
msgid "A band size cannot be negative."
msgstr "لا يمكن أن يكون حجم الشريحة سالبًا."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_component.py:0
msgid "A tier rate cannot be negative."
msgstr "لا يمكن أن يكون سعر الشريحة سالبًا."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_component.py:0
msgid "Tier %(n)s"
msgstr "الشريحة %(n)s"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_component.py:0
msgid "quantity"
msgstr "الكمية"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_import_bas.py:0
msgid "%(matched)s driver(s) filled from BAS."
msgstr "تم تعبئة %(matched)s سائق من BAS."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_import_bas.py:0
msgid ""
"\n"
"%(count)s have no BAS cost centre set: %(names)s"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"%(count)s بلا مركز تكلفة في BAS: %(names)s"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_import_bas.py:0
msgid ""
"\n"
"%(count)s had no trips in BAS this month: %(names)s"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"%(count)s بلا ردود في BAS هذا الشهر: %(names)s"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_import_bas.py:0
msgid ""
"\n"
"%(count)s already had a line in this batch and were left unchanged: %(names)s"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"%(count)s لديهم سطر في هذه الدفعة أصلًا وتُركوا دون تغيير: %(names)s"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_import_bas.py:0
msgid " and %(more)s more"
msgstr " و%(more)s غيرهم"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_import_bas.py:0
msgid "Import is only available while the batch is in Draft."
msgstr "الاستيراد متاح فقط والدفعة في وضع المسودة."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_import_bas.py:0
msgid "Select a Work Site on the batch before importing."
msgstr "حدّد موقع العمل في الدفعة قبل الاستيراد."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_import_bas.py:0
msgid "No employees are assigned to %(site)s."
msgstr "لا يوجد موظفون معيَّنون على موقع %(site)s."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_import_bas.py:0
msgid "Worked days: %(days)s. Required trips before earning: %(required).0f."
msgstr ""
"أيام العمل: %(days)s. الردود المطلوبة قبل بدء الاستحقاق: %(required).0f."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_import_bas.py:0
msgid "Imported from BAS"
msgstr "مستورَد من BAS"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_import_bas.py:0
msgid "not recorded"
msgstr "غير مسجَّل"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_recurring.py:0
msgid ""
"%(employee)s does not report to you and is not in a department you manage, "
"so you cannot set up recurring pay for them."
msgstr ""
"%(employee)s لا يتبعك إداريًا وليس ضمن قسم تديره، لذا لا يمكنك إعداد مستحقات"
" متكرّرة له."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_recurring.py:0
msgid "%(employee)s already has a recurring %(what)s starting on that date."
msgstr "لدى %(employee)s بالفعل %(what)s متكرّر يبدأ في ذلك التاريخ."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_recurring.py:0
msgid "A recurring %(name)s has to say which one it is: %(options)s."
msgstr "يجب أن يحدّد %(name)s المتكرّر أيَّها هو: %(options)s."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_recurring.py:0
msgid "The end date cannot be before the start date."
msgstr "لا يمكن أن يكون تاريخ الانتهاء قبل تاريخ البدء."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_run.py:0
msgid "%(count)s department(s) submitted to the General Manager."
msgstr "تم تقديم %(count)s قسم إلى المدير العام."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_run.py:0
msgid ""
"Only a Commission Officer can close the month by hand. Supervisors submit "
"their own department."
msgstr ""
"لا يمكن إقفال الشهر يدويًا إلا لمسؤول العمولات. أمّا المشرفون فيقدّمون "
"أقسامهم."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_run.py:0
msgid "Payment Register — %(name)s"
msgstr "سجل الصرف — %(name)s"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_run.py:0
msgid "Only the Commission Accountant can mark the month paid."
msgstr "لا يمكن تعليم الشهر مصروفًا إلا لمحاسب العمولات."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_run.py:0
msgid "Only the Commission Accountant can export the bank file."
msgstr "لا يمكن تصدير ملف التحويل البنكي إلا لمحاسب العمولات."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_run.py:0
msgid "Entries for %(name)s"
msgstr "إدخالات %(name)s"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_run.py:0
msgid ""
"You have nothing to submit for %(period)s. Record your entries first — or "
"they have already been submitted."
msgstr ""
"ليس لديك ما تقدّمه عن %(period)s. سجّل إدخالاتك أولًا — أو أنها قُدِّمت "
"بالفعل."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_run.py:0
msgid ""
"Only the company's General Manager can close a month while departments are "
"still outstanding."
msgstr ""
"لا يمكن إقفال شهر ما زالت فيه أقسام لم تُسلّم إلا للمدير العام للشركة."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_run.py:0
msgid ""
"Only the company's General Manager can return the whole month. To send back "
"one department, use Return on its own submission."
msgstr ""
"لا يمكن إعادة الشهر كاملًا إلا للمدير العام للشركة. ولإعادة قسم واحد استخدم "
"زر «إعادة» في تسليم ذلك القسم."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_run.py:0
msgid ""
"You have no department on %(period)s. Record an entry first — or ask HR to "
"set you as your department's manager."
msgstr ""
"ليس لك قسم في %(period)s. سجّل إدخالًا أولًا — أو اطلب من الموارد البشرية "
"تعيينك مديرًا لقسمك."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_run.py:0
msgid "Only the company's General Manager can reopen an approved month."
msgstr "لا يمكن إعادة فتح شهر معتمد إلا للمدير العام للشركة."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_run.py:0
msgid "The bank file can only be exported once the month has been approved."
msgstr "لا يمكن تصدير ملف التحويل البنكي إلا بعد اعتماد الشهر."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_run.py:0
msgid "An approved pay run cannot be deleted: %(names)s"
msgstr "لا يمكن حذف دورة مستحقات معتمدة: %(names)s"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_run.py:0
msgid "Only an open pay run can be submitted."
msgstr "لا يمكن تقديم إلا دورة مستحقات مفتوحة."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_run.py:0
msgid "No department has submitted anything for %(period)s yet."
msgstr "لم يقدّم أي قسم شيئًا عن %(period)s بعد."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_run.py:0
msgid "%(name)s has already been approved."
msgstr "سبق اعتماد %(name)s."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_run.py:0
msgid ""
"None of the departments waiting on %(period)s are yours to approve. Still "
"waiting on their own General Managers: %(names)s."
msgstr ""
"لا يوجد بين الأقسام المنتظِرة في %(period)s ما هو من اعتمادك. وما زالت "
"بانتظار مديريها العامّين: %(names)s."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_run.py:0
msgid ""
"No department has been approved for %(period)s, so there is nothing to pay."
msgstr "لم يُعتمَد أي قسم عن %(period)s، فلا يوجد ما يُصرَف."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_run.py:0
msgid "Only a submitted pay run can be returned."
msgstr "لا يمكن إعادة إلا دورة مستحقات مُقدَّمة."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_run.py:0
msgid "%(name)s is not approved, so there is nothing to reopen."
msgstr "%(name)s غير معتمدة، فلا يوجد ما يُعاد فتحه."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_run.py:0
msgid "Only an approved pay run can be marked paid."
msgstr "لا يمكن تعليم دورة مستحقات مصروفة إلا إذا كانت معتمدة."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_run.py:0
msgid "%(name)s has been approved. Reopen it before changing it."
msgstr "اعتُمدت %(name)s. أعِد فتحها قبل تعديلها."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_run.py:0
msgid ""
"No department has submitted its commissions for %(period)s, so there is "
"nothing to approve."
msgstr "لم يقدّم أي قسم عمولاته عن %(period)s، فلا يوجد ما يُعتمَد."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_run.py:0
msgid ""
"Cannot reopen: the unwind snapshot for %(name)s is corrupted. Manual cleanup"
" required."
msgstr ""
"تعذّرت إعادة الفتح: نسخة التراجع الخاصة بـ %(name)s تالفة. يلزم تصحيح يدوي."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_submission.py:0
msgid "Batches — %(name)s"
msgstr "الدفعات — %(name)s"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_submission.py:0
msgid "Entries — %(name)s"
msgstr "الإدخالات — %(name)s"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_submission.py:0
msgid ""
"No General Manager is set for %(scope)s. Ask HR to set the department's "
"General Manager."
msgstr ""
"لم يُعيَّن مدير عام لـ %(scope)s. اطلب من الموارد البشرية تعيين المدير العام"
" للقسم."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_submission.py:0
msgid "%(name)s is not yours to submit."
msgstr "%(name)s ليس من اختصاصك تقديمه."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_submission.py:0
msgid "Submitting this department"
msgstr "تقديم هذا القسم"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_submission.py:0
msgid "Approving this department"
msgstr "اعتماد هذا القسم"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_submission.py:0
msgid "Reopening this department"
msgstr "إعادة فتح هذا القسم"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_submission.py:0
msgid ""
"Only %(gm)s, the General Manager of %(scope)s, can act on this submission."
msgstr ""
"لا يمكن التصرّف في هذا التسليم إلا لـ %(gm)s، المدير العام لـ %(scope)s."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_submission.py:0
msgid "Only a submission still being prepared can be deleted: %(names)s"
msgstr "لا يمكن حذف إلا تسليم ما زال قيد الإعداد: %(names)s"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_submission.py:0
msgid "%(name)s has already been submitted."
msgstr "سبق تقديم %(name)s."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_submission.py:0
msgid ""
"There is nothing to submit — no entries have been recorded for %(name)s."
msgstr "لا يوجد ما يُقدَّم — إذ لم تُسجَّل أي إدخالات لـ %(name)s."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_submission.py:0
msgid ""
"These batches have no entries. Delete them or fill them in before submitting:\n"
"%(names)s"
msgstr ""
"هذه الدفعات بلا إدخالات. احذفها أو املأها قبل التقديم:\n"
"%(names)s"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_submission.py:0
msgid "%(name)s has not been submitted yet, so there is nothing to approve."
msgstr "لم يُقدَّم %(name)s بعد، فلا يوجد ما يُعتمَد."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_submission.py:0
msgid "Only a submitted department can be returned."
msgstr "لا يمكن إعادة إلا قسم مُقدَّم."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_submission.py:0
msgid ""
"Say why it is being returned — the supervisor needs to know what to fix. "
"Type it in 'Return Reason' first."
msgstr ""
"اذكر سبب الإعادة — فالمشرف يحتاج أن يعرف ما يُصحّحه. اكتبه في «سبب الإعادة» "
"أولًا."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_submission.py:0
msgid ""
"%(name)s has been approved. Only the General Manager can reopen the month."
msgstr "اعتُمد %(name)s. ولا يمكن إعادة فتح الشهر إلا للمدير العام."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_pay_submission.py:0
msgid "%(name)s has been approved and can no longer be changed."
msgstr "اعتُمد %(name)s ولم يعد قابلًا للتعديل."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_sales_commission_rule.py:0
msgid "Rule '%(n)s' has scope %(s)s but no employee."
msgstr "القاعدة «%(n)s» نطاقها %(s)s لكن بلا موظف."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_sales_commission_rule.py:0
msgid "Rule '%(n)s' has scope %(s)s but no clients selected."
msgstr "القاعدة «%(n)s» نطاقها %(s)s لكن لم يُحدَّد لها عملاء."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_sales_commission_rule.py:0
msgid "Rule '%(n)s' uses 'Custom Formula' but no formula was provided."
msgstr "القاعدة «%(n)s» تستخدم «معادلة مخصّصة» لكن لم تُدخَل أي معادلة."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_sales_commission_rule.py:0
msgid "Rule '%(n)s' must define at least one tier."
msgstr "يجب أن تحدّد القاعدة «%(n)s» شريحة واحدة على الأقل."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_sales_commission_rule.py:0
msgid "Tier percentages and rates must be non-negative."
msgstr "يجب ألّا تكون نسب الشرائح وأسعارها سالبة."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_sales_commission_rule.py:0
msgid ""
"Tier 'To %%' (%(to)s) must be greater than or equal to 'From %%' (%(fr)s)."
msgstr ""
"يجب أن تكون «إلى %%» في الشريحة (%(to)s) أكبر من أو تساوي «من %%» (%(fr)s)."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_sales_commission_rule.py:0
msgid "Reduced Rate Up To %% must be non-negative."
msgstr "يجب ألّا تكون «السعر المخفّض حتى %%» سالبة."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_sales_commission_rule.py:0
msgid "Reduced Rate Multiplier must be non-negative."
msgstr "يجب ألّا يكون «معامل السعر المخفّض» سالبًا."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_sales_commission_rule.py:0
msgid ""
"Formula on rule '%(n)s' could not be evaluated:\n"
"%(err)s"
msgstr ""
"تعذّر تنفيذ معادلة القاعدة «%(n)s»:\n"
"%(err)s"

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_sales_commission_sheet.py:0
msgid ""
"You are not allowed to confirm or reset a sales/collection commission sheet."
msgstr ""
"غير مصرّح لك باعتماد كشف عمولة المبيعات / التحصيل أو إعادته إلى المسودة."

#. module: KSW_commissions
#: code:addons/KSW_commissions/models/ksw_sales_commission_sheet.py:0
